  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : (1)/(4)div(1)/(16)-5+45×25=40\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the two signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ÷ and × \n\n(1)/(4)div(1)/(16)-5+45×25=40 \n\n⇒ (1)/(4)×(1)/(16)-5+45÷25=40\n\n (1)/(4)×(1)/(16)-5+1.8=40 \n\n(1)/(64)+1.8-5=40 \n\n(1+115.2-320)/(64)=40 \n\n(-203.8)/(64)=40 \n\n-3.18 ≠ 40 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (2) : + and − \n\n(1)/(4)div(1)/(16)-5+45×25=40 \n\n⇒ (1)/(4)div(1)/(16)+5-45×25=40\n\n4 + 5 - **45 × 25**__ = 40\n\n__**4 + 5**__ - 1125 = 40\n\n__**9 - 1125**__ = 40\n\n-1116 ≠ 40 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : × and −\n\n(1)/(4)div(1)/(16)-5+45×25=40 \n\n⇒ (1)/(4)div(1)/(16)× 5+45-25=40\n\n**4 × 5**__ + 45 - 25 = 40\n\n__**20 + 45**__ - 25 = 40\n\n__**65 - 25**__ = 40\n\n**40 = 40 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : + and × \n\n(1)/(4)div(1)/(16)-5+45×25=40 \n\n⇒ (1)/(4)div(1)/(16)-5×45+25=40\n\n4 - **5 × 45**__ + 25 = 40\n\n__**4 + 25**__ - 225 = 40\n\n__**29 - 225**__ = 40\n\n-196 ≠ 40 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.\n\n5a:T19e3",
